+
+### Support tools
+
+Staff can open `/admin/accounts` (also linked as Account support in the menu),
+select an account, and Comp or Uncomp it. Comp provides the Unlimited allowance
+without a Stripe subscription; it does not cancel any existing Stripe billing.
+An active paid plan keeps its own storage allowance even when comped.
+
+The Card count and Bytes used fields override reported billing usage without
+changing card numbering or the storage ledger. Blank fields use measured usage;
+zero is a valid override. Reset deletes the override record and returns both
